card.text:
Shadowstep {W}{U}{B} (You may cast this spell for its shadowstep cost. If you do, shuffle it into its owner's library at the beginning of the next end step.)
When Shifting Interloper enters, return target nonland permanent you don't control to its owner's hand. That player loses 3 life unless they discard a card.
Basiclandcycling {2}

Flying
Shadowstep {B}{B}
When Astral Extractor enters, target opponent exiles a card from their hand. If Astral Extractor was cast for it's shadowstep cost, that player reveals their hand instead, you choose a nonland card from it, and that player exiles that card.
